  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Line a baking sheet with parchment paper and place the pita bread on it.",
    "Bake the pita bread for 10 minutes or until crispy and golden brown.",
    "Meanwhile, cook the udon noodles according to the package instructions.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together soy sauce, sugar, and sesame oil.",
    "In a large skillet, heat a small amount of oil over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the salmon fillet and cook for 2-3 minutes or until cooked through.",
    "Remove the salmon from the skillet and set aside.",
    "Add the cooked udon noodles to the skillet and toss with the soy sauce mixture.",
    "Add the crispy pita bread, green onions, and toasted sesame seeds to the skillet.",
    "Toss everything together and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Return the salmon to the skillet and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste."
